NOTICE

This module patches defects in the Crucible game system and the Ember premium
module for Foundry Virtual Tabletop. It is an unofficial, third-party work and
is not affiliated with or endorsed by Foundry Gaming LLC or Mage Hand Press.

The MIT license above covers only the original code in this repository. It does
not grant any rights to Crucible or Ember themselves, neither of which is
redistributed here — this module contains no assets, compendium content, or
packaged code from either. Using it requires your own licensed installation.

Short excerpts of upstream source are quoted in the documentation, and one
patch (N1) reproduces the control flow of an upstream hook it must replace
wholesale, for interoperability. All such material remains the property of its
respective copyright holders.
